{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relic of the Dungeon is a horror-themed adventure game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter an ancient underground dungeon to repay your debt.<br>Retrieve the relic lying deep within the dungeon and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not kind to you. Discover the dungeon\u2019s traps on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>While living an ordinary life, you receive a request from a debt collector.</u><br><br><br><u>The request is to retrieve a relic from the underground dungeon you once explored long ago.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/5c2be8e08460b043bbbe86a6054d3068.poster.avif?t=1766371627\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/5c2be8e08460b043bbbe86a6054d3068.webm?t=1766371627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/5c2be8e08460b043bbbe86a6054d3068.mp4?t=1766371627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>You escaped this place long ago, but for some reason, you have no memory of it.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>You intend to use this opportunity to uncover that mystery.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 minutes to 1 hour 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/9ed1c506364c14990f31487413f8378b.poster.avif?t=1766371627\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/9ed1c506364c14990f31487413f8378b.webm?t=1766371627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/9ed1c506364c14990f31487413f8378b.mp4?t=1766371627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be traps in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move carefully and keep a close watch on your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/18d59f748b7e1fec77f6672582756fd9.poster.avif?t=1766371627\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/18d59f748b7e1fec77f6672582756fd9.webm?t=1766371627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/18d59f748b7e1fec77f6672582756fd9.mp4?t=1766371627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is approaching. Be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939350/extras/b27a10f4f058916189658e6f36afd94d.poster.avif?t=1766371627\" width=426 height=240 ><source src